# Build-context filter of tests/docker/fixtures/Dockerfile. The context is the repository root
# (docker-bake.hcl); BuildKit uses this file instead of the root .dockerignore, so it allowlists exactly
# what the image needs: the Go sources the server imports (internal/templates/templatestest pulls in the
# root package and its embedded files) and the server's own files.

**

!go.mod
!go.sum
!embed.go
!internal/
!schemas/
!scaffolds/
!docs/guide/
!tests/docker/fixtures/main.go
!tests/docker/fixtures/build-repos.sh
!tests/docker/fixtures/repo-task/

**/.DS_Store
